      "name": "dsh-border-collie-pet",
      "title": {
        "zh": "边牧桌宠",
        "en": "Border Collie Pet"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "一只住在桌面上的边牧，帮你盯着所有工作区的任务：跑完弹绿气泡、出错弹红气泡、等你确认弹黄气泡。支持换成自己的图片；0.6.0 起可外挂 KuroCat 打字小黑猫形象联动任务状态。",
        "en": "A border collie on your desktop that watches every workspace: green bubble when tasks finish, red when they fail, yellow when they need your confirmation. Custom image support; since 0.6.0 you can delegate the pet role to a KuroCat typing cat."
